  ["Feature a stainless steel crown relies on for retention","The cervical bulge and constriction of the primary molar crown"],
  ["Location of primate spaces","Mesial to the maxillary canine, distal to the mandibular canine"],
  ["Leeway space","Combined mesiodistal width of primary canine + molars minus permanent canine + premolars; about 2.5 mm per side mandible, 1.5 mm maxilla (Proffit)"]
